198
00:15:14,572 --> 00:15:19,767
After the fatal message, what does git
status -sb print, and which refs moved?

199
00:15:20,107 --> 00:15:24,960
For each of the three answers: how many
new commits appear, how many parents does

200
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,162
each have, and does any
existing commit get a new ID?

201
00:15:28,502 --> 00:15:32,220
Which entry will be at the top
